# Purpose
# Find the Chromium based browser path used by browser verification scripts.
#
# Common usage
# Run from the repository root.
# .\scripts\find-browser.ps1
# .\scripts\find-browser.ps1 -Browser Chrome
# .\scripts\find-browser.ps1 -Browser Edge
# .\scripts\find-browser.ps1 -ListAll
# .\scripts\find-browser.ps1 -Json
#
# Useful options
# -Browser chooses Auto, Chrome, Edge, or Chromium.
# -ListAll prints all detected candidates.
# -Json prints machine readable output.
#
# Recommended next command
# .\scripts\verify-browser-pages.ps1 -Browser Chrome
#
# Notes
# Browser paths are initialized through pages-env.ps1.
# Prefer Auto unless a specific browser must be tested.
